make('red-ghost-folklore','Red Ghost, the enormous red camel with a bleached skeleton strapped to its back','Exactly one large red camel with one head, two eyes, four legs, a single hump, shaggy rust-red fur; exactly one complete bleached human skeleton strapped onto its back with plain rawhide, no blood or tissue.','Charge directly toward viewer, open its mouth and swing one heavy foreleg forward, tumble an empty wooden wagon aside.','The documented thirty-foot sighting knocks over wagons; show real physical impact and dust, no aura.','Arizona frontier desert, dark canyon terrain with empty wooden wagons.',(['red-ghost-folklore-c02','red-ghost-folklore-c08'],['red-ghost-folklore-c15'],['red-ghost-folklore-c01','red-ghost-folklore-c11']),'Select documented giant sighting c15; skeleton is dry non-graphic bones, not gore. Single hump is minimal camel visualization.', 'Extreme low angle, thirty-foot camel dominates, tiny empty wagon makes scale unmistakable.')
make('satyrus-ape','Satyrus, the bearded manlike ape of medieval bestiaries','Exactly one hairy bearded ape with a manlike torso, one head, two eyes, two arms and two legs, dense coarse fur and plain opaque waist wrap; holds one heavy rough wooden club; no goat features.','Burst forward with exaggerated wild gesticulation, raise the wooden club over shoulder, fiercely stare down toward the viewer.','No documented magic; wild gesticulation and physical club threat only.','An indistinct dark rocky wilderness; no invented specific architecture or mythic habitat.',(['satyrus-ape-c04','satyrus-ape-c05','satyrus-ape-c06'],[],['satyrus-ape-c06']),'Wild-man illustration variant c05/c06 selected, no human giant scale. The club is documented c06; plain waist wrap editorial modesty.')
