make('shinchu','Shinchū, the giant beetlelike evil-repelling guardian','One enormous beetlelike insect body, exactly one head, two eyes and EIGHT visibly separate articulated limbs total; hard densely colored dark red and black beetle shell; no extra legs or feelers resembling limbs. One small oni figure in opaque ragged clothing held securely in the front pair of limbs.','Lean down toward camera, four rear limbs braced on rock, middle pair thrust forward and front pair gripping a small plague oni to drive it away; guardian fills frame.','Physically subdue and repel a plague oni, no invented energy, fire or magic aura.','Indistinct dark rocky ground without buildings or written scrolls.',(['shinchu-c03','shinchu-c06','shinchu-c08'],['shinchu-c01','shinchu-c03','shinchu-c04'],['shinchu-c03']),'Respectful powerful protective depiction; no copied scroll composition. Setting is neutral editorial ground, not claimed geographical place.', 'Extreme low angle; immense beetle fills frame, small oni is scale cue; count four limbs on each side clearly.')
